   "unmapped": [
    "Rewards from an exponential-family GLM with known scale parameter",
    "Noise is conditionally zero-mean and almost surely bounded by R_max",
    "N clients interact round-robin with a star-shaped network via a central server; communication cost C_T counts number of data transfers",
    "Each client has its own time-varying set of K arms per round"
   ],
   "definition_quote": "At each time step $t=1,2,...,T$, all $N$ clients interact with the environment in a round-robin manner, i.e., each client $i \\in [N]$ chooses an arm $\\bx_{t,i}$ from its time-varying candidate set ... the goal of the learning system is to minimize the cumulative (pseudo) regret over all $N$ clients ... $R_{T}=\\sum_{t=1}^{T} \\sum_{i=1}^{N}r_{t,i}$, where $r_{t,i}=\\max_{\\bx \\in \\cA_{t,i}} \\bbE[y|\\bx]- \\bbE[y_{t,i}|\\bx_{t,i}]$."
  }
